[2023-08-24 11:07:30,341] INFO in one_page_experience: 当前文本页数:0，translated_str:Bai et al. (2020) and Blum et al. (2020) techniques aim to eliminate parameters and connections that are not relevant to the accuracy of inference.Inference reusing (Guo et al 2018; Ning, Guan, and Shen 2019) approaches aim to avoid repeating the same or similar computations; Source filtering (Li et al 2020) methods try to transmit only necessary input data to backend ML models Adaptive configuration (Jiang et al 2018) and multi-model scheduling (Yuan et al 2020a) were proposed to make inference workloads adaptive to the dynamics of input content. We summarize them as answers to an interesting question: How to obtain as accurate inference as possible with limited computing resources?在不执行机器学习模型的情况下，尽可能获得结果从这个角度来看，多任务学习和模型压缩通过剪枝原始模型来生成更轻量级的模型，用于相同的推理任务。推理重用和源过滤技术通过分析输入之间的相关性，将先前的推理结果作为预测结果重新使用。Based on the observation that, for some input data, the accuracy of expensive and cheap models is similar, adaptive configuration analyzes the input dynam- ics and predicts the inference results of expensive models by executing cheap ones Adaptive multi-model scheduling predicts unnecessary inference results as empty using the ex- ecuted models’ outputs as the hint information We address this problem from a novel perspective: link- ing black-box models We were motivated by the insight that even ML models that are在输入模态、学习任务、架构等方面，不同类型的机器学习模型可以相互分享知识，因为机器学习模型容易出现“过拟合”（Song and Shmatikov 2020），不同模型的输出具有语义相关性（Tan et al 2018）如果我们能够有效地将不同机器学习模型之间的知识进行桥接，那么就可以根据已执行模型的输出来直接预测剩余模型的推断结果。如果这个预测的成本较低，那么就可以在有限的成本预算下，提高所有未执行模型推断结果的准确性，与原始工作流程相比，未执行模型的结果无法获得的情况。为了实现这一愿景，需要解决以下两个主要挑战：
1. 如何有效地将不同机器学习模型之间的知识进行桥接；
2. 如何降低预测的成本。(1) 如何在黑盒子和高度不同的机器学习模型之间建立知识水平的链接？实际上，部署的机器学习模型可以有不同的架构和输入模态，并且可以由不同的编程语言和机器学习框架开发。异构性
